=====Details=====

======Item======
Returns the item at the specified index from the list of items provided. Those items will typically be input primitives such as Integer or Real values.
 Inputs:
 [Generic] 
 [Integer] 
 Outputs:
 [Generic] 
======Length======
The number of items in the provided list of items.
 Inputs:
